{# ── Why teach AI? ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────── #}
<section class="teacher-why">
  <div class="teacher-why-inner">
    <h2 class="teacher-why-heading">Why teach AI?</h2>
    <p class="teacher-why-text">AI tools are not magic. They are systems designed by people that make mistakes and carry the values of their designers. Students who understand how these systems work can question, challenge and build them themselves.</p>
    <a class="teacher-why-cta" href="https://gen-ai.fi/fi/materials/basics" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Read AI Fundamentals for Teachers (in Finnish) →</a>
  </div>
</section>

{# ── CEDE model ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── #}
<section class="teacher-cede">
  <div class="teacher-cede-inner">
    <h2 class="teacher-cede-heading">Pedagogical approach: the CEDE model</h2>
    <div class="teacher-cede-steps">
      <div class="teacher-cede-step">
        <span class="teacher-cede-num" aria-hidden="true">1</span>
        <p class="teacher-cede-title">Contextualisation</p>
        <p class="teacher-cede-desc">Anchor AI to students' everyday lives and dispel myths.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="teacher-cede-step">
        <span class="teacher-cede-num" aria-hidden="true">2</span>
        <p class="teacher-cede-title">Exploration</p>
        <p class="teacher-cede-desc">Experimental testing: can you fool the AI? Where does it go wrong?</p>
      </div>
      <div class="teacher-cede-step">
        <span class="teacher-cede-num" aria-hidden="true">3</span>
        <p class="teacher-cede-title">Design</p>
        <p class="teacher-cede-desc">Student as builder – their own data, their own AI model.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="teacher-cede-step">
        <span class="teacher-cede-num" aria-hidden="true">4</span>
        <p class="teacher-cede-title">Ethics</p>
        <p class="teacher-cede-desc">Who benefits? Who could be marginalised? What values does the system carry?</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <a class="teacher-cede-link" href="https://gen-ai.fi/fi/materials/basics" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Read AI Fundamentals for Teachers (in Finnish) →</a>
  </div>
</section>

{# ── Get Started ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── #}
<section class="teacher-steps">
  <div class="teacher-steps-inner">
    <h2 class="teacher-steps-heading">Get Started</h2>
    <ol class="teacher-steps-list">
      <li class="teacher-step">
        <div class="teacher-step-num" aria-hidden="true">1</div>
        <div class="teacher-step-body">
          <h3 class="teacher-step-title">Read AI Fundamentals for Teachers <span class="teacher-step-lang-note">(available in Finnish)</span></h3>
          <p class="teacher-step-desc">Background on AI fundamentals, the CEDE model and lesson ideas. <a href="https://gen-ai.fi/fi/materials/basics" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Open AI Fundamentals for Teachers ↗</a></p>
        </div>
      </li>
      <li class="teacher-step">
        <div class="teacher-step-num" aria-hidden="true">2</div>
        <div class="teacher-step-body">
          <h3 class="teacher-step-title">Choose an app</h3>
          <p class="teacher-step-desc">Six free apps for different themes – all run in the browser with no installation. <a href="/en/materials/">See all apps →</a></p>
        </div>
      </li>
      <li class="teacher-step">
        <div class="teacher-step-num" aria-hidden="true">3</div>
        <div class="teacher-step-body">
          <h3 class="teacher-step-title">Start with a ready-made unit</h3>
          <p class="teacher-step-desc">Complete 4–6 lesson units with lesson plans and activities included. <a href="/en/materials/">Browse teaching units →</a></p>
        </div>
      </li>
    </ol>
  </div>
</section>

