{# ── About the project ───────────────────────────────────────────────────── #}
<section class="teacher-about">
  <div class="teacher-about-inner">
    <h2 class="teacher-about-heading">We develop apps and materials together with teachers</h2>
    <p class="teacher-about-text">The project organises co-design projects for pre-primary and primary school teachers and student teachers. The goal is for learners to understand AI-related safety issues and technologies through experimentation and invention.</p>
    <p class="teacher-about-text">All apps are designed to scale – they work on any device without installation or registration.</p>
    <a class="teacher-about-link" href="/en/activities/">Read more about project activities →</a>
  </div>
</section>

